<title>USA: Conn. Housing Finance Authority repriced, ylds cut.</title>
<headline>Conn. Housing Finance Authority repriced, ylds cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said Wednesday it repriced Connecticut Housing Finance Authority's $75 million bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities while leaving the top yield in 2028 unchanged at 5.85 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
